                <pb facs="0953" n="855" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg855"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Peirce.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-10-26"><hi rendition="#italic">October 26,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Mr. Hay directs Mr. Peirce to endeavor to secure the omission of the provision
                    proposed by the Russian Government, fourth paragraph, second page of the
                    protocol, which is not acceptable to this Government; to proceed as indicated in
                    instruction No. 89, and report the result of his efforts.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
